1
00:00:00,485 --> 00:00:01,295
What?!

2
00:00:01,453 --> 00:00:03,053
I'm back down to nine friends!

3
00:00:04,255 --> 00:00:06,325
(Sheldon:)Make it eight.
I'm sick of Wolowitz, too!

4
00:00:07,659 --> 00:00:09,999
(Leonard:)I don't understand.

5
00:00:10,161 --> 00:00:13,071
(Leonard:)All you've done since you discovered
this stupid element was complain.

6
00:00:13,231 --> 00:00:14,401
I was trying to make you happy!

7
00:00:14,566 --> 00:00:17,016
(Sheldon:)By taking away
my only claim to fame?

8
00:00:17,168 --> 00:00:18,668
(Sheldon:)Well, if you wanted
to make me happy,

9
00:00:18,837 --> 00:00:20,107
(Sheldon:)you could have told me a joke.

10
00:00:20,271 --> 00:00:23,441
(Sheldon:)Or shown me a cute video
of a koala and an otter

11
00:00:23,608 --> 00:00:24,948
(Sheldon:)becoming unlikely friends.

12
00:00:26,077 --> 00:00:28,357
(Leonard:)There is no winning with you.

13
00:00:28,513 --> 00:00:30,753
(Leonard:)And koalas and otters
don't even live near each other!

14
00:00:30,849 --> 00:00:33,159
(Sheldon:)That's what makes
their friendship unlikely!

15
00:00:33,852 --> 00:00:36,262
Hey!
What's with all the yelling?

16
00:00:36,821 --> 00:00:38,201
(Sheldon:)Leonard disproved my element.

17
00:00:38,356 --> 00:00:41,096
(Sheldon:)Now all the attention
is going to go away.

18
00:00:41,259 --> 00:00:42,599
(Penny:)Oh, that's great.
You must be thrilled!

19
00:00:42,760 --> 00:00:45,210
That's it!
I'm down to seven friends.

20
00:00:47,165 --> 00:00:49,505
(Penny:)He's counting Hobbits
and superheroes, right?

21
00:00:49,868 --> 00:00:52,978
(Sheldon:)When I thought the element was real,
I didn't want it.

22
00:00:53,138 --> 00:00:54,808
(Sheldon:)But now that Leonard
made it not exist,

23
00:00:54,973 --> 00:00:56,643
(Sheldon:)I want it more
than anything in the world.

24
00:00:56,875 --> 00:00:58,875
(Ira:)The element
never existed.

25
00:00:59,043 --> 00:01:00,683
(Leonard:)I didn't take it away,
science took it away.

